WEBVTT

00:08:59.001 --> 00:09:02.644
Don't assume you're too junior
or people are too busy.

00:09:03.048 --> 00:09:05.024
Reach out, network.

00:09:05.638 --> 00:09:07.051
JG: That's great advice,

00:09:07.075 --> 00:09:10.231
and leads us to the most
important lesson of all --

00:09:10.255 --> 00:09:11.405
go for it.

00:09:12.003 --> 00:09:13.952
NOI: Yes, go for it.

00:09:14.531 --> 00:09:16.709
JG: (Laughs) Thank you.

00:09:16.733 --> 00:09:17.883
NOI: Thank you.